Swagger UI lets you test API endpoints directly from your browser without building a frontend.

Method	Purpose	Example in our project
GET	Retrieve data	Get previous research reports
POST	Create/submit data	Submit a new research question
PUT	Replace existing data	Replace a research record
PATCH	Partially update data	Update research job status
DELETE	Delete data	Delete a research report

An endpoint is a specific URL through which an API provides a particular operation.

FastAPI is a python framework, helps us build API

Step 1: Create the POST /research endpoint--> Allow a user to submit a research question through an API and receive the generated market research report.